        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-sequence-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Organize ordered explanations",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Use the ordering words to organise points or actions. They number the sequence rather than claiming that one event causes the next. 首先…然后… orders actions. 于是 introduces the consequence that follows from the previous situation, not merely the next item in a list.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "首先看书，其次问问题。",
                "pinyin": "shǒuxiān kàn shū ， qícì wèn wèntí 。",
                "meaning": "First read, then ask questions.",
                "audio": "a174ffa8ccb723df7aabc2129e71df40a835fb8c7af89621901157081d0bdd46"
              },
              {
                "text": "首先看书，然后问问题。",
                "pinyin": "shǒuxiān kàn shū ， ránhòu wèn wèntí 。",
                "meaning": "First read, and then ask questions.",
                "audio": "ac27c434fba67bd5266ebd762234cb1d955f2433cb84fa095efecdb6dc7c262e"
              },
              {
                "text": "下雨了，于是我们回家。",
                "pinyin": "xiàyǔ le ， yúshì wǒmen huí jiā 。",
                "meaning": "It started raining, so we went home.",
                "audio": "1e7d3d7a4ab647662cb1f2fa15098d9a44f541be34f135ad9250455ffe7ae228"
              }
            ]
          },
